From 4b12c6c66c931b182d8bf988c426a8cd92b436a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:25:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 026/214] dt-bindings: clock: mediatek: Add MT6858 clock
 controllers

Add the MT6858 apmixedsys, topckgen, pericfg_ao and infracfg_ao clock
controllers, which work like their MT8196 counterparts, including the
hardware voter for some topckgen muxes and pericfg_ao gates, and the
clock IDs. infracfg_ao moves from the plain syscons to the clock
controllers, and the hardware voter it refers to becomes a syscon.
---
 .../bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8196-clock.yaml |   2 +
 .../clock/mediatek,mt8196-sys-clock.yaml      |   2 +
 .../devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml       |   2 +-
 .../dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6858-clock.h | 232 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 237 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6858-clock.h

